msgid "First, install the system dependencies and configure the pip mirror."
msgstr "首先，安装系统依赖并配置 pip 镜像。"

msgid ""
"Optional: If you are working on an x86 machine or using a TorchNPU "
"development version, configure pip's `extra-index`:"
msgstr "可选：如果您在 x86 机器上工作或使用 TorchNPU 开发版本，请配置 pip 的 `extra-index`："

msgid ""
"Then, choose one of the following methods to install `vllm` and `vllm-"
"ascend`."
msgstr "然后，选择以下方法之一安装 `vllm` 和 `vllm-ascend`。"

msgid "=== \"Standard pip wheel\""
msgstr "=== \"标准 pip wheel\""

msgid "???+ warning \"The standard installation currently supports only A2\""
msgstr "???+ warning \"标准安装目前仅支持 A2\""

msgid ""
"The standard PyPI `vllm-ascend` wheel is currently built for **A2** and does"
" not automatically support A3, 310P, or 950DT. For other hardware, use a "
"prebuilt image, WheelNext, or a source installation."
msgstr ""
"标准 PyPI `vllm-ascend` wheel 目前仅针对 **A2** 构建，不会自动支持 A3、310P 或 "
"950DT。对于其他硬件，请使用预构建镜像、WheelNext 或源码安装。"

msgid "=== \"uv-WheelNext\""
msgstr "=== \"uv-WheelNext\""

msgid ""
"WheelNext selects a vLLM Ascend wheel that matches the hardware from the "
"variant index. First, install and verify `uv`:"
msgstr "WheelNext 会从变体索引中选择与硬件匹配的 vLLM Ascend wheel。首先，安装并验证 `uv`："

msgid "Check the device build type:"
msgstr "检查设备构建类型："

msgid "???+ tip \"Clear the cache if uv installation fails\""
msgstr "???+ tip \"如果 uv 安装失败，请清除缓存\""

msgid ""
"If `uv pip install` fails because of a corrupted cache or stale package "
"data, clear the uv cache before running the installation command again:"
msgstr "如果 `uv pip install` 因缓存损坏或包数据过期而失败，请在重新运行安装命令之前清除 uv 缓存："

msgid "uv cache clean"
msgstr "uv cache clean"

msgid "=== \"Source installation\""
msgstr "=== \"源码安装\""

msgid "???+ warning \"A3\""
msgstr "???+ warning \"A3\""

msgid ""
"When building custom operators for A3, run `git submodule update --init "
"--recursive` manually or make sure that the environment has internet access."
msgstr ""
"在为 A3 构建自定义算子时，请手动运行 `git submodule update --init --recursive`，或确保环境可以访问互联网。"

msgid "Install the vLLM Ascend dependencies first, then install vLLM:"
msgstr "首先安装 vLLM Ascend 依赖，然后安装 vLLM："

msgid ""
"Finally, handle `triton` and `triton-ascend` according to the hardware:"
msgstr "最后，根据硬件处理 `triton` 和 `triton-ascend`："

msgid "=== \"A2 / A3 / 950DT\""
msgstr "=== \"A2 / A3 / 950DT\""

msgid ""
"The installation directories of `triton` and `triton-ascend` overlap. "
"Uninstall both packages before installing the matching version of `triton-"
"ascend`:"
msgstr ""
"`triton` 和 `triton-ascend` 的安装目录重叠。在安装匹配版本的 `triton-ascend` 之前，请先卸载这两个包："

msgid ""
"For more information about installation directory conflicts, see [Triton-"
"Ascend > FAQ](https://github.com/Ascend/triton-"
"ascend/blob/main/docs/en/FAQ.md#1-installation-and-environment-"
"configuration)."
msgstr ""
"有关安装目录冲突的更多信息，请参阅 [Triton-Ascend > 常见问题](https://github.com/Ascend/triton-"
"ascend/blob/main/docs/en/FAQ.md#1-installation-and-environment-"
"configuration)。"

msgid "=== \"310P\""
msgstr "=== \"310P\""

msgid ""
"310P does not support `triton` or `triton-ascend`. If either package is "
"already installed in the environment, uninstall it and do not reinstall "
"`triton-ascend`:"
msgstr ""
"310P 不支持 `triton` 或 `triton-ascend`。如果环境中已安装任一包，请将其卸载，并且不要重新安装 `triton-"
"ascend`："

msgid "???+ note \"Other vLLM Ascend versions\""
msgstr "???+ note \"其他 vLLM Ascend 版本\""

msgid ""
"When installing another version of `vllm-ascend`, check the repository's "
"`requirements.txt` for the corresponding `triton-ascend` version."
msgstr ""
"安装其他版本的 `vllm-ascend` 时，请查看仓库的 `requirements.txt` 以获取对应的 `triton-ascend` 版本。"

msgid "??? tip \"If pip cannot verify the Huawei Cloud mirror certificate\""
msgstr "??? tip \"如果 pip 无法验证华为云镜像证书\""

msgid ""
"The Huawei Cloud package index uses HTTPS, so `--trusted-host` is not "
"normally required. If pip reports an SSL certificate verification or "
"untrusted-host error for `mirrors.huaweicloud.com`, first update pip and the"
" operating system CA certificates, or configure the CA bundle required by "
"your network."
msgstr ""
"华为云软件包索引使用 HTTPS，因此通常不需要 `--trusted-host`。如果 pip 针对 `mirrors.huaweicloud.com` 报告 SSL 证书验证错误或不受信任主机错误，请先更新 pip 和操作系统 CA 证书，或者配置网络所需的 CA 证书包。"

msgid ""
"As a temporary workaround on a trusted network, retry the vLLM Ascend "
"installation command with `--trusted-host mirrors.huaweicloud.com`."
msgstr ""
"在可信网络中，可采用临时解决方法：在 vLLM Ascend 安装命令中添加 `--trusted-host mirrors.huaweicloud.com` 后重试。"

msgid ""
"This option tells pip to trust the host even when HTTPS validation fails, "
"which weakens protection against man-in-the-middle attacks. Use it only when"
" you trust the network and cannot fix the certificate configuration."
msgstr ""
"此选项会让 pip 在 HTTPS 验证失败时仍信任该主机，从而削弱对中间人攻击的防护。仅当你信任当前网络且无法修复证书配置时使用。"
